Mais que um aplicativo, é um aplicativo de delivery que permite aos seus clientes visualizarem o cardápio ofertado pelo estabelecimento e fazerem pedidos pelo smartphone, sendo uma ferramenta ideal para aumentar seus ganhos e prática facilitando que o pedido possa ser entregue onde o cliente se encontrar no momento do pedido. 
Funcionalidades:
- cadastro rápido ou cadastro pelo facebook;
- cardápio ilustrativo, com preços dos produtos;
- pedidos sem taxas para o cliente;
- taxa de entrega é cobrada pelo restaurante;
- pagamento online;
- pagamento na maquininha.

Available only in Georgia (Sakarvelo);
Download Now Wendy’s, DUNKIN’ & SUBWAY Georgia mobile app! Place order, get lots of rewards and special offers!

From this app you can easily:

•⁠  ⁠Place order ahead at preferred restaurant, while you are on the way and get your meal without standing in line. You can even schedule the order pickup time;
•⁠  ⁠Get reward points on every purchase you made through this app at every Wendy’s, DUNKIN’ & SUBWAY restaurant;
•⁠  ⁠Exchange your reward points to various products which you can find in Wendy’s, DUNKIN' & SUBWAY gifts;
•⁠  ⁠Check-in daily and get different special offers tailored for you;
•⁠  ⁠Add your best pick products under “Favorite” tab and order easily;

Enjoy hole new experience with Wendy’s, DUNKIN’ & SUBWAY Georgia loyalty app and please do share your feedback. 

Note: Reward scheme is common for all three brands. You can earn and exchange points from one another.
